-- On your line (C13, docs/plans/on-your-line-plan.md, decided 2026-10-31 by the Project manager under Milin's delegation): user_settings.show_on_map is "Show my pitstop on the map", off until the person turns it on, so nobody is opted in by this migration. On, signed-in people with an active goal on the same skill count the person (shown only as a count of 3 or more) and the person's connections see their name; companies, public profiles and email never read it. Expand only: one new column with a default.
ALTER TABLE "user_settings" ADD COLUMN "show_on_map" boolean DEFAULT false NOT NULL;
